  "description": "Certificate of\r\nLawful Proposed Development:&nbsp;Front Porch,&nbsp; Conversion of garage to habitable room, Replace garage door with window in front elevation,&nbsp;Alterations to\r\nroof to form end gable and rear dormers, one with Juliette balcony,&nbsp;Installation\r\nof five roof lights in front roof slope, one roof light in rear roof slope, Single storey detached outbuilding to rear for use as Storage/Office&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The volume of the proposed end gable and rear dormers exceeds 50 square metres and is therefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class B.1(d)(ii) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The structure of the proposed outbuilding exceeds 2.5 metres within 2 metres of the boundary of the curtilage of the dwellinghouse and is therefore not within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Class E.1(e)(ii) of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 as amended.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposal is NOT therefore a lawful development.&lt;/p&gt;"
